"<strong>Sales App</strong>: Sell treatment packages, gift cards, and retail products with clear quotations\n"
"              and pricing."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Aplikasi Sales</strong>: Jual paket perawatan, gift card, dan produk "
"ritel dengan penawaran\n"
"              dan harga yang jelas."

